{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07751","headline":"夜泊庐江闻故人在东寺以诗寄之 · 孟浩然","name":"夜泊庐江闻故人在东寺以诗寄之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江路经庐阜，松门入虎谿。\n闻君寻寂乐，清夜宿招提。\n石镜山精怯，禅枝怖鸽栖。\n一灯如悟道，爲照客心迷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07751.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07751","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}